  "content": "<h1>Pling</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/haykam821/Pling/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/release/haykam821/Pling.svg?style=popout&label=github\" alt=\"GitHub release\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=popout&label=curseforge&message=project&color=6441A4\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhaykam.com%252flinks%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?style=popout&label=chat&message=discord&color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p>在 Minecraft 加载完成后播放音效。</p>\n<p>Pling 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 模组加载器</a>。</p>\n<h2>安装</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>从 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pling/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/haykam821/Pling/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 下载 Pling。</li>\n<li>将下载的文件放入你的 <code>mods</code> 文件夹中。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>配置</h2>\n<p>可以通过编辑 <code>config/pling.json</code> 文件或安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 模组来修改配置。使用 Mod Menu 时，可以在游戏内查看各项配置的说明。</p>\n<h2>用法</h2>\n<p>当 Minecraft 加载完成时（无论是启动时还是资源包更改后），都会播放一个可自定义的“叮”声。</p>",
